commit 2a10c65a24db77a2e62397f812c0c4bddf24f705
Author: cracki <cracki@gmail.com>
Date:   Wed Oct 7 16:57:32 2026 +0330

    fix(qa4-img29,qa4-MOM): outputs gate completion + site-data cache expiry + error-leak fix
    
    Post-review hardening (internal adversarial QA pass):
    - img29: get_completion_error now ALSO requires the derived outputs —
      ad_generation, visual, review (approved) — so the Complete action
      returns 400 with the missing list on a mid-work campaign, exactly as
      the client requested for the completion CONDITION (not just the
      progress count). CampaignCompleteGatingTests updated + new 400 test.
    - MOM 'انقضای کش' (was silently unaccounted): reused website scrapes
      expire after SITE_DATA_MAX_AGE_DAYS (env, default 30 days) — an
      expired row is re-scraped instead of served forever
      (brand/services/full_analysis.py) + 2 tests (expired rescraped,
      fresh reused).
    - brand/views.py competitor identification no longer raises
      APIException(str(exc)) — generic message + logger.exception, matching
      the payload-hygiene rule applied elsewhere.
    - Accurate upload whitelist note: png/jpeg/webp/svg (no pdf — the FE
      only sends image/*); commit bdc6e37's message overstated this.

